#!/usr/bin/env bash
# Second batch of model-sheet generations (two at a time). Run from the repo root.
G=docs/reference/generated/work; I=art/moxie_e/img.sh
HS="Identical design to the reference images: warm tan skin, amber-gold eyes, slim dark brows, messy dark-brown hair with spiky bangs and a crown tuft and TWO high spiky pigtails tied with red bands, yellow over-ear headphones with yellow headband, grey hinges and a dark triangle mark on each cup, black choker with metal ring, thin yellow cables, bare shoulders. Clean cel-shaded anime model-sheet style, bold black ink outlines, flat colours with one shade tone, even flat lighting, no cast shadows, plain flat mid-grey background, no text."
ST="Clean cel-shaded anime model-sheet style, bold black ink outlines, flat colours with one shade tone, even flat lighting, no cast shadows, plain flat mid-grey background."
(IMG_SIZE=1536x1024 IMG_BG=opaque bash $I edit $G/head_q34_1.png "Head model sheet: draw the head and neck from the first image (front) and second image (profile) in a THREE-QUARTER view: head turned 45 degrees toward the viewer's right, so we see the front of the face and her right cheek with the small white bandage strip; neutral calm closed-mouth expression; both eyes visible, far eye foreshortened; near headphone cup with triangle, both pigtails visible, yellow triangle hair clip in the fringe on her right side. Framing from the top of the hair to the collarbones, everything inside the frame, same scale as the references. $HS" $G/head_front1.png $G/head_side1.png &
 IMG_SIZE=1536x1024 IMG_BG=opaque bash $I edit $G/head_back1.png "Head model sheet: draw the head and neck from the first image (front) and second image (profile) in a strict orthographic BACK view, seen directly from behind: no face visible. Show the back of the dark-brown hair: a centre parting running down to a short tapered spiky nape, the hair swept up on both sides into the two high spiky pigtails tied with red bands, the crown tuft, the yellow headband arching over the top, the backs of both yellow ear cups with grey hinges, the back of the black choker with a small buckle, thin yellow cables, bare shoulders and upper back. Framing from the top of the hair to the shoulders, both pigtails fully inside the frame, same scale as the references. $HS" $G/head_front1.png $G/head_side1.png $G/back_a1.png; wait)
(IMG_SIZE=1536x1024 IMG_BG=opaque bash $I edit $G/gear_audio1.png "Prop call-out sheet for a 3D modeller, gear of the character in the first image (the original concept painting is the second image). Six separate object drawings on a plain mid-grey background, neatly spaced in two rows, no character, no hands. Top row: her HEADPHONES drawn three times: front view (yellow padded headband, grey metal hinge yokes, round yellow ear cups with a bold dark triangle mark, grey cushion rings, thin yellow cable), side view of one ear cup, three-quarter view. Bottom row: her belt cassette WALKMAN drawn three times: front view (chunky yellow cassette player with a dark cassette window showing two tape reels, grey metal corner guards, small buttons, a belt clip, a yellow cable socket), side view showing its thickness, buttons and belt clip, back/three-quarter view. Retro cassette-era tech with a scavenged, slightly scuffed look. $ST No text, no labels, no arrows, no logos, no letters." $G/front_a3.png $G/R01_crop.png &
 IMG_SIZE=1536x1024 IMG_BG=opaque bash $I edit $G/gear_wear1.png "Prop call-out sheet for a 3D modeller, gear of the character in the first image (the original concept painting is the second image). Separate object drawings on a plain mid-grey background, neatly spaced in two rows, no character body. Top row: (1) her WRIST DEVICE: a chunky dark bracer with yellow trim and a small glowing cyan screen showing a diamond glyph, drawn from the top and from the side; (2) the dark fingerless GLOVE with the two striped wrist bands, back of hand view; (3) her UTILITY BELT laid out flat and straight, full length: dark brown webbing belt with a big grey metal buckle with a yellow bar, pouches, a carabiner with a chain, a grey gadget pouch with a cyan screen, a glass vial glowing cyan in a brass holder, small yellow and red cartridges, and two long magenta straps with grey buckles hanging down. Bottom row: her BOOT drawn three times: side view, front view, back view: chunky high-top boot, cream-white toe cap and thick cream lugged sole, dark brown leather panels, yellow laces, a small yellow triangle patch on the cream tongue, grey eyelets, a yellow heel accent. $ST No text, no labels, no arrows, no letters." $G/front_a3.png $G/R01_crop.png; wait)
(IMG_SIZE=1536x1024 IMG_BG=opaque bash $I edit $G/tpose_back1.png "Character model sheet: draw the character in a strict orthographic BACK view (seen directly from behind, no face) in a true T-POSE exactly matching the pose, scale, height and framing of the first image (the front T-pose): both arms stretched straight out horizontally at shoulder height, palms down, legs straight slightly apart. Use the second image (the A-pose back view) for every back detail: back of the hair with both pigtails and red bands, yellow headband, backs of the ear cups, choker, crop top back and harness strap, the dark cropped jacket draped low across the upper back with its yellow collar folded down and the yellow triangle emblem on the back panel, sleeves following the horizontal arms with the white chevrons on her right sleeve (right of the picture), belt with the yellow Walkman and magenta straps on the right of the picture and the cyan vial and gadgets on the left of the picture, olive cargo pants with back pockets and the yellow zig-zag on the right leg, rolled cuffs, heels of the cream and brown boots. $ST One figure, full body and both hands inside the frame with margin, no text." $G/tpose_a1.png $G/back_a1.png &
 IMG_SIZE=1024x1536 IMG_BG=opaque bash $I edit $G/q34back_1.png "Character turnaround model sheet: using the back view (first image) and the left-side profile (second image) as references, draw the same character in a THREE-QUARTER BACK view: seen from behind and from her left, body rotated so her back and her left side are visible, face turned away (only a sliver of cheek). Same A-pose: arms straight about 35 degrees from the body, palms down, legs straight slightly apart. Same scale and height in frame, identical outfit details: two high spiky dark-brown pigtails with red bands, yellow headphones with triangle marks, choker, cream crop top back with harness strap, dark cropped jacket with yellow collar draped low across the back with the yellow triangle emblem, plain dark left sleeve, wrist devices, fingerless gloves, belt with the cyan vial, chain and gadget pouch on her left hip, olive baggy cargo pants with back pockets and rolled cuffs, cream and dark-brown boots. $ST One figure, full body with margin, no text." $G/back_a1.png $G/left_a2.png; wait)
